flowchart TD
    Bpf["BPF program emits<br/>at high rate"]
    Reserve["bpf_ringbuf_reserve(sz)"]
    Check{Reserve<br/>returned NULL?}
    Drop["increment 'drops' counter<br/>(BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERCPU_ARRAY)"]
    Submit["bpf_ringbuf_submit"]
    Done["return 0"]

    User["Userspace consumer<br/>periodically reads drops counter"]
    Diag["log: 'dropped N events<br/>since last sample'"]

    Bpf --> Reserve
    Reserve --> Check
    Check -->|yes ringbuf full| Drop
    Drop --> Done
    Check -->|no| Submit
    Submit --> Done

    User -.->|read drops map| Diag

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    classDef us fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    class Submit,Done ok
    class Drop bad
    class User,Diag us
